          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/99696f740f6046b7a0a34e30a954f81f_l06b01-antes-hacia-la-tarea-en-la-biblioteca.mp3?Expires=1794099528&Signature=xPdoSSyl1O5b9DoJqjql9xJU~i5XIuAyvdC0ob5e1nfYZxAnD6ojznGOjjMR8q9bn2d-1OlU8ZZrcDdYZwJ4vB~cZLt-PcUVnk-xnY4asj1wyDo9fH02A3stNloo~kruvMe9mwcafBwO8XSkRrdxAlm9Wl-i5T5wGy3YavKwGZhsnl2QoAgyXkHbuAm6QSSN84rzkhw93gMlTRZIjFrpWou2d7LdvsKljotauy69HgsMeoh3XaZZc7UJPmYh2cQRwuPgMp8~CILzYC2LRUEDVpL~QdP~zk7ULkoRNgi0GjZJVQm6ShLnrYCTW1gE8Ue0Y8lKRW2eTs7mu11SVoRFxw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
